<p><strong>ERRATA:</strong></p>

<ol>
  <li>
    <p>There is a mistake in the slide at ~35:00. I neglected to add $\UNCHANGED N$. The $FactAlg$ spec should read:</p>

    <script type="math/tex; mode=display">% <![CDATA[
\begin{alignat}{1}
&FactAlg \defeq \;& \LET fact[n \in Nat] \defeq \IF n \leq 1 \;\THEN 1 \;\ELSE n * fact[n - 1]\\
&&\IN N \in Nat \land f = 0 \land\; \Box[f' = fact[N] \land \UNCHANGED N]_{\seq{N, f}}\\
\end{alignat} %]]></script>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>In 26:24, I say “function” (twice!) when I mean to say “action”. It should be: “every time we have the box operator followed by an <em>action</em>, that <em>action</em> must be inside square brackets.”</p>
  </li>
</ol>


